Subject: [PATCH 164/165] KVM: selftests: TDX: Add shared bit to MMIO address

TDG.VP.VMCALL<MMIO> requires MMIO address to have shared bit and TDVF and
TD guest Linux does so.  Make selftest conform to it.

GHCI spec
  TDG.VP.VMCALL<#VE.RequestMMIO>
  The VMM may emulate MMIO space in shared-GPA space.

Signed-off-by: Isaku Yamahata <isaku.yamahata@intel.com>
---
